{"version":1,"id":"alessia-cara-here","title":"Here","artist":"Alessia Cara","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/alessia-cara/here/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Hayes Isaac, Samuel Gerongco, Bobby Brass, Oak, Andrew D Wansel, Coleridge G Tillman and Terence Po Lun Lam","chords":[{"symbol":"Dm/C","canonical":"Dm/C","keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Dm/B","canonical":"Dm/B","keyboardPitchClasses":[],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A#7M","canonical":"A#maj7","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5,9],"interpretation":"Keyboard interpretation: A#maj7"},{"symbol":"Dm","canonical":"Dm","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,5,9],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Intro]","columns":34,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":20,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Dm","column":26,"beat":6},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":30,"beat":8}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm sorry if I seem uninterested","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":16,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh I'm not listenin', oh I'm indifferent","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Truly I ain't got no business here","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":15,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"But since my friends are here, I just came to kick it","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"But really I would rather be at home all by myself","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Not in this room with people who don't even care about my well being","columns":68,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"I don't dance, don't ask, I don't need a boyfriend","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"So you can, go back, please enjoy your party","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll be here, somewhere in the corner","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":16,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Under clouds of marijuana with this boy who's hollering","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"I can hardly hear, over this music I don't listen to","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And I don't wanna get with you so tell my friends that I'll be over here","columns":72,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":34,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":63,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh, here, oh here","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#7M","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm","column":11,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh I asked myself, what am I doin' here, oh here, oh here","columns":57,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":35,"beat":2},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":44,"beat":4},{"symbol":"Dm","column":51,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"And I can't wait 'til we can break up out of","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Excuse me, if I seem a little unimpressed with this","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"An antisocial pessimist, but usually I don't mess with this","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"And I know you mean only the best and your","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Intentions aren't to bother me, but honestly I'd rather be","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Somewhere with my people, we can kick it and just listen to","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Some music with a message, like we usually do","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And we'll discuss our big dreams, how we plan, to take over the planet","columns":70,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"So pardon my manners, I hope you understand that I'll be here","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Not there in the kitchen with the girl who's always gossipin'","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"About her friends, oh tell them I'll be here","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Right next to the boy who's throwin' up 'cause he can't take what's in","columns":70,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"His cup no more oh God why am I","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"Hours later congregatin' next to the refrigerator","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Some girl's talkin' 'bout a hater, she ain't got none","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"How did it ever come to this I should've never come to this","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"So holla at me, I'll be in the car when you're done","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm stand-offish, don't want what you're offerin'","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm done talkin', awfully sad it had to be that","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"Way so tell my people when they're ready that I'm ready","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"And I'm standin' by the tv with my beanie low yo I'll be over","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"instrumental","text":"[Final]","columns":40,"beats":10,"changes":[{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":14,"beat":1},{"symbol":"Dm","column":20,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Dm/C","column":24,"beat":3},{"symbol":"Dm/B","column":30,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A#7M","column":36,"beat":5}]}]}